                      The Sword of Dawn           By: subhaan
-----------------------------------------------------------

A swordsman named Kaito hunted shadow creatures that appeared only at night.
Unlike other warriors, he refused to hate the creatures. He believed they were once human.
During his final battle, Kaito defeated the Shadow King but spared his life long enough to learn the truth: the creatures had been cursed centuries ago.
Instead of celebrating victory, Kaito searched for a cure. His kindness freed the remaining shadows from their suffering.
Sometimes the strongest blade is compassion.
